<h2>Relative Speed in Opposite Directions</h2>

<p>
When two objects move towards each other, both objects reduce the distance
between them.
</p>

<p>
Therefore, their speeds contribute together.
</p>

<p>
<b>Relative speed = v₁ + v₂</b>
</p>

