<p><b>Step 2:</b> Identify time.</p>
<p>t = 4 h</p>

<p><b>Step 3:</b> Use d = st.</p>

<p>
d = 60 × 4
</p>

<p><b>Answer = 240 km</b></p>

<h3>Worked Example 2</h3>

<p>
A cyclist covers 90 km in 3 hours. Find the speed.
</p>

