x = bags of maize
</p>

<p>
y = bags of beans
</p>

<p>
and:
</p>

<p>
x + y ≤ 50
</p>

<p>
The boundary:
</p>

<p>
x + y = 50
</p>

<p>
represents using exactly 50 bags in total.
</p>

<p>
The feasible side represents combinations using 50 bags or fewer.
</p>

<h3>Worked Example 2</h3>

