<h3>Example 1</h3>

<p>
Suppose the corner values are:
</p>

<ul>
<li>A → 1,200</li>
<li>B → 1,800</li>
<li>C → 2,500</li>
<li>D → 2,000</li>
</ul>

<p>
The greatest value is:
</p>

<p>
<b>2,500</b>
</p>

<p>
Therefore C gives the maximum objective value.
</p>

<h3>Example 2</h3>

<p>
Suppose:
</p>

