P = 500x + 300y
</p>

<p>
and:
</p>

<ul>
<li>(0,0) → P = 0</li>
<li>(4,0) → P = 2,000</li>
<li>(3,4) → P = 2,700</li>
<li>(0,5) → P = 1,500</li>
