<p>
The greatest profit is KSh 3,400.
</p>

<p>
Therefore the optimal point is:
</p>

<p>
<b>(5,2)</b>
</p>

<h3>Rule</h3>

<p>
<b>Maximization → choose the greatest objective value.</b>
