C = 400(5) + 300(1)
</p>

<p>
C = 2000 + 300
</p>

<p>
C = 2300
</p>

<h3>Corner 3: (4,4)</h3>

<p>
C = 400(4) + 300(4)
</p>

<p>
C = 1600 + 1200
</p>

<p>
C = 2800
</p>

<h3>Corner 4: (1,5)</h3>

<p>
C = 400(1) + 300(5)
</p>

<p>
C = 400 + 1500
</p>

<p>
C = 1900
</p>

<h3>Compare</h3>

<p>
The smallest value is:
</p>

<p>
<b>700</b>
</p>

<p>
Therefore:
</p>

<p>
<b>Optimal point = (1,1)</b>
</p>

<p>
