single cell?</p>

<p><b>Step 1:</b> Xylem is made from many specialised cells and vessel
elements.</p>

<p><b>Step 2:</b> These structures work together in water transport.</p>

<p><b>Answer:</b> Xylem is a tissue because multiple specialised
structures work together to perform transport.</p>
