  <h2>Genotype</h2>

  <h3>What is a genotype?</h3>

  <p>
    A <b>genotype</b> is the genetic constitution of an individual for a
    particular gene or characteristic.
  </p>

  <p>
    In simple inheritance questions, genotype is often represented using
    letters that show the alleles an individual possesses.
  </p>

  <h3>Example</h3>

  <p>
    Suppose:
  </p>

