<h3>Worked Example 2</h3>

<p>
Smoke from burning fuels can release gases and particles into the atmosphere.
</p>

<p>
Some air pollutants can harm respiratory systems and contribute to environmental problems.
</p>

<h3>Worked Example 3</h3>

<p>
Pesticides entering soil or water can affect organisms that were not intended to be controlled.
</p>

<h3>Key Idea</h3>

<p>
Pollution can affect organisms directly or indirectly by changing the conditions of their habitat.
</p>
