<h3>DEEP NOTES</h3>

<p>Phototropism and gravitropism are both examples of tropisms.</p>

<p>A tropism is a directional growth response to a stimulus.</p>

<h3>Phototropism</h3>

<p>The stimulus is light.</p>

<p>Shoots generally show positive phototropism.</p>

