    <h3>5. Expressions of frequency</h3>
    <p>Phrases such as <em>every day, once a week</em> and <em>twice a month</em> also express frequency. They commonly appear at the end of the clause.</p>
    <p><strong>Example:</strong> Our class meets twice a week.</p>
