  (1842, 1842, '
    <h2>Adverbs of Degree</h2>
    <p>Adverbs of degree express the intensity, extent or completeness of an adjective, adverb or action.</p>

    <h3>1. Common adverbs of degree</h3>
    <ul>
      <li><em>very</em> — to a high degree</li>
