    <h3>Titles of works</h3>
    <p>Capitalisation of book, film and other work titles depends partly on the style guide. In title case, important words are capitalised; in sentence case, usually only the first word and proper nouns are capitalised. Follow the required style consistently.</p>

    <p>Always distinguish a specific name from a general description.</p>
