    <h2>Apostrophes in Contractions</h2>
    <p>A contraction combines words by leaving out one or more letters. An apostrophe marks the missing letters.</p>

    <h3>Common contractions</h3>
    <ul>
      <li>do not → don''t</li>
      <li>cannot → can''t</li>
      <li>is not → isn''t</li>
      <li>they are → they''re</li>
      <li>we have → we''ve</li>
      <li>she will → she''ll</li>
