      <p>Through school activities, I have developed communication, teamwork and record-keeping skills. I can follow instructions carefully, handle assigned tasks responsibly and work cooperatively with others. I am also willing to learn your procedures for serving customers and arranging stock.</p>

      <p>I would welcome an opportunity to discuss my suitability for the position. I am available for an interview at your convenience and can provide further information if required.</p>

      <p>Thank you for considering my application.</p>

