    <h2>Curriculum Vitae (CV)</h2>

    <p>A CV summarises a person''s education, skills, experience and relevant achievements. It should be truthful, easy to scan and tailored to the opportunity. A student with little employment history can include school responsibilities, volunteering and relevant projects.</p>

