  (4352, 3302, 'Diamond is suitable for cutting and drilling tools because its rigid three-dimensional network of strong covalent bonds makes it extremely hard and resistant to scratching.', TRUE),
  (4353, 3303, 'Graphite conducts electricity because each carbon atom contributes an electron to a delocalised system, allowing electrons to move through the layers and carry charge.', TRUE),
