  (5478, 4428, 'M could be better if it provides affordable useful energy, is reliably available, and can be used safely with acceptable environmental impacts. Its lower calorific value means more mass may be required.', TRUE),
  (5479, 4429, 'A physical property is a characteristic that can be observed or measured without changing a substance into a different substance.', TRUE),
